        "deno + yt-dlp-ejs solve player signatures",
        "Cookies from S3 pass the datacenter bot check"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Operations",
      "items": [
        "Channels live in DynamoDB, edited from the admin chat",
        "Alarms: dead letters, a stuck queue, dead cookies",
